    "created_at": "2023-07-24T18:49:32Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-07-24T18:49:32Z",
    "body": "On a side note, I was curious what the participant agreement would be. In the [WHATWG FAQ](https://whatwg.org/faq) I found the \"participate\" button which leads to https://participate.whatwg.org/ , but there I was blocked by CloudFlare. A futile annoyance, as I can still [read it on the Wayback Machine](https://web.archive.org/web/20230706034429/https://participate.whatwg.org/).\r\nI know WHATWG somehow loves CloudFlare but I still believe they should use something that grants even suspicious people at least read-only access. Ideally something that also is not [a danger to the open internet](http://cryto.net/~joepie91/blog/2016/07/14/cloudflare-we-have-a-problem/).",
